  "description": "After her \"storm kick\" video goes viral on the Internet, Baek-hui is too humiliated and ashamed to live in Korea and wants to relocate to a different country. To do so, she agrees to marry Han-Gyeol, who holds a permanent resident status in Australia, and plans to divorce him as soon as she gets her visa. However, to receive their marriage certificate, they must prove that their love is \"legit.\" How are they going to do that when their marriage is a fraud? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited) \n\n*Note: Chapter count includes an extra.*",
